C C G G|A A G2|F F E E|D D C2|G G F F|E E D2|
w: Twin-kle, twin-kle, lit-tle star, How I won-der what you are! Up a-bove the world so high,
G G F F|E E D2|C C G G|A A G2|F F E E|D D C2|]
w: Like a dia-mond in the sky. Twin-kle, twin-kle, lit-tle star, How I won-der what you are!
